  m_Name: DilemmaAutomacaoColeta
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::RandomEventData
  _title: "Triagem autom\xE1tica do lixo"
  _description: "Uma central mecanizada separaria recicl\xE1veis em escala muito
    maior que as cooperativas de catadores. Elas, que vivem desse trabalho, perguntam
    o que ser\xE1 delas."
  _titleEn: Automated waste sorting
  _descriptionEn: A mechanized plant would sort recyclables at a far larger scale
    than the waste picker cooperatives. They live off this work, and they are asking
    what will become of them.
  _triggerConditions: []
  _statEffects: []
  _minTurn: 6
  _maxTurn: 17
  _choices:
  - Rule:
      Effects:
      - Parameter: 0
        Amount: -3
      - Parameter: 5
        Amount: 4
      - Parameter: 3
        Amount: 2
      FollowUpEventId: 
      FollowUpDelay: 0
    Label: Automatizar e requalificar
    LabelEn: Automate and retrain
    Detail: A central entra junto com um plano para os catadores. Custa bem mais.
    DetailEn: The plant comes with a plan for the waste pickers. It costs far more.
  - Rule:
      Effects:
      - Parameter: 5
        Amount: 3
      FollowUpEventId: ConsequenciaColetaDesemprego
      FollowUpDelay: 3
    Label: "Automatizar sem transi\xE7\xE3o"
    LabelEn: Automate with no transition
    Detail: Mais material reciclado com menos gente na folha de pagamento.
    DetailEn: More material recycled with fewer people on the payroll.
  - Rule:
      Effects:
      - Parameter: 0
        Amount: -1
      - Parameter: 5
        Amount: 2
      - Parameter: 3
        Amount: 2
      FollowUpEventId: 
      FollowUpDelay: 0
    Label: Fortalecer as cooperativas
    LabelEn: Strengthen the cooperatives
    Detail: "Menos escala, mas quem j\xE1 faz o trabalho continua nele."
    DetailEn: Less scale, but those already doing the work keep it.
